<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Diagnose</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Fighter, Healer, Druid, Conjurer, Assassin (guild level 0); Dark Knight, Paladin, Ranger (1); Thief (4); Necromancer (5)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>diagnose &lt;character&gt;
diagnose                (whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>Tells you how badly hurt someone is, from "in an excellent condition" to 
"bleeding awfully from big wounds". It works on friends and foes alike, and 
in the middle of a fight: with no name, you diagnose the one you are 
fighting. Outside a fight you also see how heavy and how tall they are.
</p><p>Your skill and your brain decide how true the answer is: when you misjudge, 
they look healthier than they really are.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
